          "settings": {
            "question": "Cosmetic injectors :",
            "answer": "<p>For cosmetic injectors and Clinical spa therapists performing delicate procedures, sub-millimeter stability is non-negotiable. The option between a high-capacity hydraulic foot pump (Model 20200) and a smooth motorized lift system (Model 20210) enables precise vertical positioning to the desired working height. Practitioners can elevate or lower the client to the exact working height needed for symmetrical sightlines, minimizing visual fatigue and improving treatment consistency.</p>"
          }
        },
